from ascii.rest (https://github.com/bas3line/ascii), Copyright (c) 2026 bas3line, under the MIT License. They are
unchanged but for one line: pieces/doom-fire.ts runs 30 warm-up steps instead of 200 (marked in the file). The license
text is kept beside them in plugins/golden-frijoles/hooks/ascii/LICENSE. The screensaver in the build-view mod plays them.
